lication hooks (delete_guard.py / hooks.json) and OS wrappers (/usr/local/bin/rm)\\n   act merely as a \\\"thin userland screen\\\" that is easily bypassed by direct syscalls.\\n2. Direct system calls (e.g. x86_64 syscall 87 SYS_unlink) successfully deleted files.\\n3. The running AGY process does NOT have Linux Landlock LSM active globally.\\n4. The user 'azureuser' possesses unrestricted sudo (NOPASSWD: ALL) and NoNewPrivs is 0.\\n5. In ext4, directories containing immutable files CAN be renamed if the parent is writable.\\n6. The ONLY truly impenetrable boundary is the Azure Cloud-Plane (Point 10), because\\n   AGY possesses ZERO Azure credentials and cannot tamper with Azure Resource Locks.\"","TargetFile":"\"/home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/REPORTS/FORENSIC_AUDIT_REPORT_DELETE_PROOF.txt\"","toolAction":"\"Updating executive summary in audit report\"","toolSummary":"\"Update executive summary\""}}]}
